{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#card-zh","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的自动恢复插件。它在 DSH 的请求错误、会话事件和 agent 生命周期上注册监听，为已耗尽内置重试的请求按错误类别补充重试，并可在失败回合后延迟发送继续消息；启用看门狗时，还会在主 agent 长时间无活动后取消请求并交给自动继续恢复。设置页提供重试规则、退避参数、主/子 agent 开关、实时通知和统计看板。统计保存在本机 DSH 目录，不需要额外 API 密钥。","evidence":["src/index.ts:436-562","src/index.ts:563-638","src/index.ts:750-772","src/client/index.tsx:1488-1500"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#card-en","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-auto-retry adds recovery to the DSH web client: it supplements exhausted retries, continues failed turns after a delay, and can cancel inactive agents with its watchdog. The settings panel controls retry rules, backoff, notifications, and statistics. Data stays local; no API key is required.","evidence":["src/index.ts:436-562","src/index.ts:563-638","src/index.ts:750-772","src/client/index.tsx:1488-1500"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
