{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#feature-1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 的功能「补充请求重试」：内置策略耗尽后按失败类别追加重试。触发于请求错误，可配置规则次数、固定或指数退避，并优先采用 Retry-After。","evidence":["src/index.ts:436-562"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#feature-2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 的功能「失败回合自动继续」：主 agent 终局失败后等待配置时长，再发送可自定义的继续消息；等待期间用户介入会取消排队，连续失败达到上限则熔断。","evidence":["src/index.ts:563-638"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#feature-3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 的功能「无响应看门狗」：启用后监视主 agent 的事件和流活动，超过阈值即取消请求并触发恢复；用户停止不会走这条自动继续路径。","evidence":["src/index.ts:750-772"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#feature-4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 的功能「统计看板」：设置页可查询重试、继续、失败回合和 provider 等聚合统计，也能查看近期事件并选择时间范围。","evidence":["src/index.ts:830-946","src/client/index.tsx:1090-1160"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#feature-5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 的功能「实时状态通知」：客户端订阅事件流并展示重试、继续倒计时和看门狗状态；设置中可关闭通知。","evidence":["src/index.ts:293-318","src/index.ts:932-945","src/client/index.tsx:1427-1478"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
{"unit_id":"zxmqq1234__dsh-auto-retry#feature-6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-auto-retry 的功能「重试配置面板」：在 Web 设置区编辑失败规则、次数、退避模式、主子 agent 行为和看门狗阈值，并保存配置。","evidence":["src/client/index.tsx:1488-1500","src/client/index.tsx:1680-1800"],"repo":"zxmqq1234/dsh-auto-retry","commit":"3eaade311307e5e7e3c6ba31ad29d06671cdac3f","source":"generated"}
